          },
          "actions": {
            "value": null
          },
          "category": "class",
          "description": {
            "value": "<p>You can use your shield to fend off explosions and the like. When you @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.actionspf2e.Item.Raise a Shield]{Raise your Shield}, you gain your shield's circumstance bonus to Reflex saves.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Special</strong> If you have the @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.feats-srd.Item.Shield Block] reaction, damage you take as a result of a Reflex save can trigger that reaction, even if the damage isn't physical damage.</p>"
          },
          "level": {
            "value": 6
